        "decoDesc": {
            "id": -1966526382216022393,
            "text": "Xircon Effluent is a form of partially inactivated Liquid Xiranite, but a fraction of its constituents remains in a hyperactive state. Energy of the Originium constituents within Liquid Xiranite gradually dissipates during various applications. This \"desiccation\" process would occasionally trigger the activation of Feranmut power within the Xiranite."
        },
        "desc": {
            "id": -377327533771285978,
            "text": "A solution acquired by chemically reacting Liquid Xiranite with Sewage. It can be used to produce other materials, or processed at the Water Treatment Unit to render it harmless."
